e, and fare breakdown.\n\n6. **Refined 3D Anti-Gravity Tilt Physics**:\n   - Smooth 60fps mouse-following perspective tilt (`perspective(1000px) rotateX(...) rotateY(...) translateZ(10px)`) with leak-free event handling.\n\n7. **Zero Academic CS / Data Structure Jargon**:\n   - 100% natural transit logistics semantics.\n\n---\n\n## 📁 Source Files\n- **Application**: [index.html](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html)\n- **Design System**: [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/styles.css)\n- **Engine Logic**: [app.js](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/app.js)\n- **Operating Manual**: [README.md](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/README.md)\n","Description":"Updated walkthrough.md for NexusMobility Light Eco-Tech upgrade","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Kartik Bhosle\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md for NexusMobility Light Eco-Tech upgrade"}}]}
